/**
 * Every Prisma model carrying a `tenantId` column. Generated by inspecting the
 * schema; the unit test `tests/tenant-models.test.ts` fails if the schema and
 * this list drift apart, so a new tenant-scoped model cannot be added without
 * also being isolated.
 */
